<title>JAPAN: FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF JAPAN STOCKS IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF JAPAN STOCKS IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of July 28 to August 1, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers for the 16th consecutive week.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   807.25 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  642.75 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			 164.51 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying	62.03 billion yen</p>
</text>
